nnot separate real defensive adjustment from offense executing differently; near-uniform transition matrices consistent with label noise.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 523 cells; 440 pairs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-010", "score": 0.105, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-010 | Study family SF-APPS-010: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets\n- observed_research_question: Play-type PPP change across playoff series game buckets\n- auto_outcome_status: inconclusive\n- observed_hypothesis: Play-type PPP (especially DRIVE) declines as a playoff series progresses, so DRIVE is a good early-series call.\n- observed_result: DRIVE 0.889 -> 0.949 (+0.060); CUT +0.114; PNR +0.087; PULL_UP -0.077; POST_UP -0.032.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean\n- observed_failure_evidence: 'NO CLEAR SIGNAL - DRIVE PPP is stable or improves across the series'; observational with selection caveats.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 1197 records; no CIs\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Pooled (series, team, PT, bucket) records (1197), EARLY G1-2 / MID G3-4 / LATE G5-7, min 10 poss, min 3 series.\n- observed_verdict: null\n- observed_failure_type: E_unclear"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-027", "score": 0.1, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-027 | Study family SF-APPA-027: Agent Test B: LLM counter selection vs deterministic BEST tier\n- observed_research_question: Agent Test B: LLM counter selection vs deterministic BEST tier\n- auto_outcome_status: untestable\n- observed_hypothesis: The LLM picks the same counter as the BEST tier, and when it disagrees it is right in H2.\n- observed_result: Agrees with BEST 1/3; picks AVOID 2/3; disagreements engine right 2/2; mean H2 PPP BEST 1.650, agent 1.154, AVOID 0.642.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: n=3 triggers; caveat says 230+ disagreements needed.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=3\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-028\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPA-028\n- observed_method: 3 suppression triggers; H2 PPP as referee.\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable"}], "n_results": 4}

